Hi Uday,
The following worked for me. I hope it helps.
Alan

install.packages("RSelenium") # RSelenium 1.7.1
library(wdman)
library(RSelenium)
cdrv <- chrome(verbose = FALSE, check = FALSE, port = 4567L) # check = TRUE downloads executable if missing
